<<
/Title (Universal Basic Income is often presented as the "Great Narrative" \(Goeritz R. \(2025\) The Great Narrative of Universal Basic Income \(UBI\)\) of the Electric Technocracy. In India, research into UBI as a transformative policy has shown that periodic cash transfers can effectively alleviate poverty and empower individuals to pursue education and entrepreneurial activities. In the context of the future of humanity, UBI is the mechanism that allows for the shift from "work" as a survival necessity to "human flourishing" as a self-actualized goal. )
/Dest [19 0 R /XYZ 72.338379 382.46973 0]
/Parent 1148 0 R
/SE 302 0 R
/Prev 1203 0 R
/Next 1199 0 R
>>
endobj
